[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_6MY_C18_RAIN_SHINE_FOALS_BREATH]
A foal’s breath from where flowers bloom

[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_6MY_C18_RAIN_SHINE_FOALS_BREATH_DESC]
A leader devoted her political career to “Silence”, only to watch it crumble in the last few years and everything left to her successor. Before leaving, she gave this flower to Autumn Blaze as a memento.
“I have made an irreparable mistake, and nothing can clear my sins. I’m sorry, Autumn Blaze.” She left this sentence before leaving.
When Autumn Blaze stopped her and tried to persuade her in confusion, “Leader, if you are referring to the ‘silence’. Though I’ve stopped the ‘silence’, I never ever thought you made a mistake. I think your choice was right under the circumstances at that time.”
But Rain Shine didn’t say anything, just shook her head and left the garden. After that, Autumn Blaze didn’t hear much from Rain Shine, and her proclaimed singing career seemed to have never restarted.

[l_simp_chinese.INVENTORY_ITEM_6MY_C18_RAIN_SHINE_FOALS_BREATH]
鲜花盛开之处的一枝稚马之息

[l_simp_chinese.INVENTORY_ITEM_6MY_C18_RAIN_SHINE_FOALS_BREATH_DESC]
一位领袖将她的政治生涯全部奉献给了“静默”，然而却在最后几年默许了“静默”的崩塌，将一切交给了她的继任者。在离开之前，她最后留下了这一枝花，送给秋烨作为纪念。
“我已经犯下了无可挽回的错误，无论做什么也不能赎清我的罪孽。对不起，秋烨。” 她在离开之前，最后留下了这样一句话。
当秋烨拦住她不解地尝试说服：“领袖，如果您指的是‘静默’。即使我解除了‘静默’，我从未认为您犯下了错误。我认为在当时的情况下，您的选择是正确的。”
但雨晴没有说话，只是摇摇头，转身离开了花园。后来，秋烨也不怎么听到雨晴的消息了，她所宣称的歌唱事业，似乎也从未再开始过。

